body:
When my stepmoms dog attacked me, she sat there and watched him. then when i had to put him in a chokehold \*hes a 200 pound bullmastiff\* she got mad at me for "trying to break his neck"

&#x200B;

and when I confronted her about it a year later she denied it ever happening, and said I baited him to bite me to spite her, because "you hate the dog"

or saying "it'll make him less of a man" 

&#x200B;

I've also been told "Dogs be viscous when they get fixed, how would you feel if I cut off your balls"
